340311288833618,"text_excerpt":"I'm a snowball snob. It's snow BALL, not snow CONE, not shave ice (they're all minutely different, but I'm still a snowball snob haha). So I was less than thrilled that someone had come along and tried to \"fix\" perfection by adding anything beyond condensed milk on top. Well.... I'll eat my words this time because putting cheesecake in a snowball and adding toppings is GENIUS!!! It's GENIUS I tell you. Their key lime pie special tastes just like a cold, creamy delicious key lime pie, and I dream about their Chantilly cake flavor when it's 80+ degrees outside. Plus it has fruit on top, so it's basically healthy for you! ;) All jokes aside, seriously. This place is super cool and the staff ..."},{"business_id":"4EaRjOTNIo-72sQMf-Wykg","review_id":"Mp0a_Frh9XT_6E7M6yrJ1w","date":"2017-05-11T03:28:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9293524026870728,"text_excerpt":"Sno-la is one of my favorite go to places for a great snowball! They aren't the fastest but their cheesecake stuffed snowballs are absolutely fantastic! Grab one of their signature flavors or create your own if you dare to be different.. The Uptown location is much smaller than their Metairie location so there's no inside seating besides a bench. But, if you're up for a nice stroll once you get your treat it's very nice. Also, if you bring in your previously purchased mason jar for a refill you'll get your snowball at a discounted price. There's also a Sno-la app in the iPhone App Store where you can earn loyalty points FYI. Android app coming soon. Lol"},{"business_id":"4EaRjOTNIo-72sQMf-Wykg","review_id":"lTo_WlbbMlbZdNctWMsw0w","date":"2019-03-30T21:53:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9278525114059448,"text_excerpt":"Sno-La has Fast service and a great selection of flavors especially with the stuffed cheesecake. We had the Tres Leches stuffed with ice-cream and the blueberry cream cheese snowballs. Both were awesome and the ive was soft felt like eating ice cream. Ill definitely be frequenting this spot this summer."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4EaRjOTNIo-72sQMf-Wykg","photo_id":"rwfThpsRGugk8zYtgslclA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rwfThpsRGugk8zYtgslclA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9279905557632446},{"business_id":"4EaRjOTNIo-72sQMf-Wykg","photo_id":"f9dfVowXMFInIMGq3DAwTA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/f9dfVowXMFInIMGq3DAwTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8864673376083374},{"business_id":"4EaRjOTNIo-72sQMf-Wykg","photo_id":"dbmeL9zIanlTgzqb93NBDw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dbmeL9zIanlTgzqb93NBDw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8751511573791504}]},"notebook_case":null}
